Package: com.qcom-toolbox.no-sep-bootloop
Name: No SEP Bootloop
Version: 1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Removes the Face ID & Passcode / Touch ID & Passcode settings entry entirely and blocks any passcode/biometric enrollment screen, to avoid SEP/AP desync bootloops on jailbroken devices.
Maintainer: qcom-toolbox
Author: qcom-toolbox
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 12.0)
